{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55416","headline":"望庐山 · 沈彬","name":"望庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东过匡庐忍醉眠，双眸尽日挂危巅。\n压低吴楚殽涵水，约破云霞独倚天。\n一面峭来无鸟径，数峰狂欲趁渔船。\n江人莫笑偏凝望，卜隐长思瀑布前。\n（以上四首均见《吉石盦丛书》影印日本高山寺藏宋抄本陈舜俞《庐山记》卷四。\n）（按：《望庐山》三四两句，《全唐诗》卷七四三已据《野客丛书》卷十七收入，「殽」作「遥」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}